# Copy to `.env` in the project root (see src/config/env.js).
# Required when the device is NOT on the same LAN as the backend (cellular, other Wi‑Fi, EAS APK).
#
# ── ngrok (must match a RUNNING tunnel; URL changes each time you restart ngrok unless reserved) ──
# 1. In Cabroster-BE, note PORT in .env (often 4000).
# 2. Run:  ngrok http 4000   (same number as PORT)
# 3. Copy the https://....ngrok-free.dev host and set:
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=https://YOUR-SUBDOMAIN.ngrok-free.dev/api/v1
# 4. Restart Metro. Test in phone browser: same URL with /api/v1/docs or /api/v1/health
#
# Full path including /api/v1:
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=https://your-api.example.com/api/v1
#
# Or host only — /api/v1 is appended automatically:
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=https://your-api.example.com
